{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "身為苦本覺悟早修"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "共四篇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛號隨意所增，\n不增亦可"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隨意所祝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在卷首第一段"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古本云：延祐乙卯四月十四日命工刊板，至十月初一夜刊至此板，出舍利一顆。初七日刊至法字上，\n又出舍利一顆。下元日刊至聖字上，又現舍利一顆。見存板中，留以供養云。伏望觀此文者、覩此靈驗\n者，同生深信堅固之心，請遵熏修，必生淨土。是即龍舒居士所謂自古及今修持者眾，豈無感應！斯言\n倍不輕也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋迦佛親以此教二老人，無可疑者。若人至心持念，及誦往\n生真言，解冤延壽得大福報，證無生忍居不退地，豈不偉歟？呂元益謹勸。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長行寫者是十二因緣圖，短行寫者是三界六道圖。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "及一切受用，即所謂不苦不樂受者是也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此卷後附周大資、劉侍制、大慧杲禪師題跋三段"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宗賾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宗賾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宗賾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宗賾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "允迪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "身為苦本覺悟早修"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雪峰頌「一盞孤燈照夜臺，上床脫了襪和鞋，三魂七魄夢中去，未委明朝來不來？」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長魁詩云「紅紅白白莫相瞞，無位真人赤肉團，敗壞不如猪\n狗相，只今便作死屍看。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "淨土文「皮包血肉骨纏筋，顛倒凡夫認作身。到\n死始知非是我，從前金玉附他人。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古頌云「父母恩深終有別，夫妻義重也分離。人情似鳥同林宿，大限來時各自飛。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "延光集「鑊湯爐炭喧幽壞，劍樹刀山聳太清。受罪要終入萬劫，獄率牛頭始放行。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寒山頌云「胭脂畫面嬌千樣，龍\n麝薰衣悄百般。今日風流都不見，綠楊芳草髑髏寒。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寒山云：「雀啄鴉餐皮肉盡，\n風吹日炙髑髏乾。目前試問傍觀者，自把形骸子細看。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寒山云：「百骸潰散離塵泥，一物長靈復是誰？不得此時\n通線路，骷髏著地幾人知？」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作此願已便止，不必禮拜。要盡此一生不得一日暫廢。唯將不廢，自要其心，得生彼國"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并回向發願文，共四篇，事盡理到，皆先覺所撰。凡修淨業者隨意互用。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天堂佛國之報"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "破人迷暗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不如默以養氣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有傷人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "地獄畜生之報"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "稱人長同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "實濟人用"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "行則誤人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "說人短同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甲午"}
